su name chirp draft retry fromindex num 1 toindex num 3 be ceremony def
  ob name text chirp draft pass be equally from text true then
  ob name text chirp draft source thrust pass be equally from text true then be depart do
  ob text "" to name text chirp replacement feedback be text do
  ob name text chirp total letters retry pass be equally from text false then
  ob text "Shorten hard. Keep the draft between 140 and 220 characters. Prefer 2 short sentences." to name text chirp replacement feedback be text do
  ob name text chirp draft source thrust pass be equally from text false then
  ob text "Stay closer to the source wording. Remove unsupported concrete claims, ideological labels, and sharpened generalizations." to name text chirp retry source thrust feedback be text do
  ob name text chirp replacement feedback to name text chirp retry feedback base be text do
